      "confidence": "★",
      "effect": "~1.00x across four directions: LDS halving (reaches 2 wg/CU) flat geomean, K-per-block doubling flat, host dispatch collapse +0.36%, HIP-graph capture/replay +0.75% - both host deltas inside the smallest case's spread",
      "attempts": 4,
